# ==============================================================================
# Purpose: Git ignore rules enforcing secret exclusion, build artifact hygiene,
#          and OS/IDE noise filtering for the Agent Gateway Demo repository.
# Architecture/Context: Root VCS security boundary preventing credentials,
#          runtime state checkpoints, and virtual environments from entering Git.
# Dependencies/Side Effects: Applies recursively across all subdirectories.
# Author: Pradeep Singh
# License: Apache-2.0
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets, Credentials & Environment Files (NEVER COMMIT)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
*.p12
*.pfx
*credentials*.json
*service-account*.json
*service_account*.json
application_default_credentials.json

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Provisioning State, Deployment Metadata & Runtime Local Ledgers
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.state/
.local_data/
**/deployment_metadata.json*
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
.terraform/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python Virtual Environments, Caches & Build Artifacts
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.venv/
venv/
env/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
dist/
build/
*.egg-info/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Operating System & Editor / IDE Noise
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
